---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { routePath } from '../../../i18n/routes';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy policy — Christian Dirnhofer"
  description="Privacy policy of Christian Dirnhofer, translated from the German original."
  altHref={routePath('privacy', 'de')}
>
  <div class="shell legal">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

    <p class="notice mono-label">
      This is a translation for convenience. The German version at
      <a href="/de/datenschutz/">/de/datenschutz/</a> is the legally binding one.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">Controller</h2>
    <p>
      Christian Dirnhofer, Neuschmied 12, 83246 Unterwössen, Germany.<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:christian@dirnhofer.net">christian@dirnhofer.net</a>
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">Hosting by GitHub Pages</h2>
    <p>
      This website is hosted by GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San
      Francisco, CA 94107, USA, as GitHub Pages. When the site is accessed,
      GitHub processes technically necessary connection data in server log
      files, in particular your IP address, the date and time of access, the
      page accessed, the browser type, and the operating system. The legal
      basis is Art. 6 Abs. 1 lit. f DSGVO; my legitimate interest lies in the
      secure and reliable operation of this website. Processing also takes
      place in the USA. Details can be found in GitHub's privacy statement at
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        docs.github.com
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">No cookies, no tracking</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not set cookies, does not embed any analytics or
      tracking services, and does not use advertising networks. No profiling
      takes place.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">Fonts</h2>
    <p>
      All fonts used are served from this server. There is no connection to
      Google Fonts or any other external service.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">Local browser storage</h2>
    <p>
      A short intro animation is shown the first time the site is opened in a
      browser session. To prevent it from repeating, an entry is stored in
      your browser's <code>sessionStorage</code>.
    </p>
    <p>
      The home page also contains a terminal, which can unlock the cv via a
      <code>login</code> command. On a successful entry, a second
      <code>sessionStorage</code> entry is stored, so the cv page knows it was
      unlocked when it is opened.
    </p>
    <p>
      Both entries contain no personal data, are never transmitted to me, and
      are deleted when the browser tab is closed. The legal basis is § 25
      Abs. 2 Nr. 2 TDDG, as both entries are strictly necessary to provide the
      respective presentation you requested.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">Contacting me by email</h2>
    <p>
      If you write to me by email, I process the information you provide in
      order to handle your enquiry, on the basis of Art. 6 Abs. 1 lit. b or
      lit. f DSGVO. I delete this data as soon as it is no longer required for
      that purpose and no statutory retention obligations apply.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mono-label">Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access (Art. 15 DSGVO), rectification (Art. 16
      DSGVO), erasure (Art. 17 DSGVO), restriction of processing (Art. 18
      DSGVO), data portability (Art. 20 DSGVO), and a right to object to
      processing (Art. 21 DSGVO). To exercise these rights, please contact the
      address given above.
    </p>
    <p>
      You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory
      authority. The competent authority is the Bayerisches Landesamt für
      Datenschutzaufsicht, Promenade 18, 91522 Ansbach.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 3.5rem);
    padding-block: 2rem 1rem;
  }
  .legal {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .legal a:hover {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .notice {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
